strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    cuda_field_access_hardcoded_local_state_space_2026_11_26, 0, "Both CUDA backends (plugins/backend_cuda and legacy compiler/backend/cuda_backend) emitted GetField/SetField as ld.local/st.local regardless of the base pointer's memory space, so a struct field access through a kernel global pointer (or a GEP of one) faulted on the device. Legacy cuda_type_size also summed Tuple element sizes without alignment padding (u8,u64,u8 -> 10 instead of 24)."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    cuda_field_access_hardcoded_local_state_space_2026_11_26, P1, verified, "CUDA GetField/SetField hardcode .local state space for global struct pointers", src/plugins/backend_cuda/cuda_backend.spl, 930, test/02_integration/gpu/cuda_struct_field_layout_live_spec.spl, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-26, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    cuda_field_access_hardcoded_local_state_space_2026_11_26, 0, "Red on NVIDIA GB10 (aarch64, driver 580.173.02): cuda_struct_field_layout_live_spec write_pairs kernel emitted st.local.u64 [%r2+0] on a global GEP pointer; launch returned 700 (CUDA_ERROR_ILLEGAL_ADDRESS), memcpy -700."
    cuda_field_access_hardcoded_local_state_space_2026_11_26, 1, "Fix: field_base_space resolves the pointer's tracked provenance (kernel arg Global, GEP inherits, Alloc Local, Shared via cvta.to.shared) and fails closed without one, same owner as Load/Store; by-value aggregate bases stay .local. Legacy Tuple sizing now aligns each element and the total. Green: live spec 2/2 on the GB10 with 0 device mismatches; cuda_backend_intensive_contract_spec 33/38 (5 pre-existing failures unrelated: 2 old control-flow/direct-call examples, 3 caused by interpreter_same_name_class_method_dispatch_collision_2026_11_26)."

